            "description": {
              "value": "You descend from an angel\u2014a winged messenger from Nirvana or one of the other celestial realms\u2014which gives you a knack for cultures and languages. You gain the trained proficiency rank in Society. If you would automatically become trained in Society (from your background or class, for example), you instead become trained in a skill of your choice. You know the Celestial language, and you gain the Multilingual skill feat."
